    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-sdd1-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-sdd1-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the S-DD1, the decompressor that sits between the ROM and the
  console in two Super Nintendo cartridges and expands graphics on the way past.
  There is no published suite for it, so it is settled against streams of noise
  compressed by an independent encoder, which exercises every path the arithmetic
  decoder has without carrying a byte of anybody's artwork.
keywords:
  - emulation
  - super-nintendo
  - s-dd1
  - decompression
  - arithmetic-coding
  - hardware-model
  - conformance
